  "onboardingSensitiveTitle": "About recording intercourse",
  "onboardingSensitiveBody": "You can record intercourse, and whether it was protected. It is the most sensitive thing Selene stores. Recording it is optional, it stays on your phone like everything else, none of it reaches us, and it is never used to predict anything. The app lock in Settings can ask for your fingerprint or PIN before anything shows.",
  "@onboardingSensitiveBody": {"description": "Shown during onboarding, before the user has recorded anything. It names the most sensitive field the app holds rather than letting them find it themselves, and points at the app lock in the same breath."},
