  "checkerEntrySubtitle": "What the US labels of medicines, and NCCIH's fact sheets on herbs, say about each other.",
  "checkerIntro": "Add two or more medicines, or a herbal supplement and a medicine. For each pair, this shows whether they share an ingredient, an FDA drug class or a group such as “NSAIDs”, and quotes any place where one label names the other or a group it is in. A herb is compared by NCCIH's fact sheet on it. It reads the labels and the fact sheets and nothing else, so it cannot tell you that a combination is safe.",
